{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260627_153755_p68_b27", "persona_id": "db:68", "outcome": "WALK_AWAY", "content": "1. 用户首次问价时，必须立即给出价格范围或具体数字，不能以“查系统”拖延超过1轮。", "difficulty_rating": 7, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260627_154002"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260627_153755_p68_b27", "persona_id": "db:68", "outcome": "WALK_AWAY", "content": "2. 线下店场景中，当用户多次追问价格时，应停止体验引导，直接回答价格或提供报价单。", "difficulty_rating": 7, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260627_154002"}
