{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260627_153755_p68_b27", "persona_id": "db:68", "outcome": "WALK_AWAY", "content": "4. 对于价格敏感型用户，优先使用“价格锚定”或“性价比计算”话术，而非反复强调产品体验。", "difficulty_rating": 7, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260627_154002"}
{"type": "key_lesson", "session_id": "session_20260627_153755_p68_b27", "persona_id": "db:68", "outcome": "WALK_AWAY", "content": "5. 销冠应熟练使用店内工具（如系统查询、报价单），避免口头承诺但无实际行动。", "difficulty_rating": 7, "status": "candidate", "exported_at": "20260627_154002"}
